														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1446463">
									

<p>Actually, what's great about this is that the kid who killed the squirrel is the <em>real</em> threat here. But he's a threat the police will deal with later on down the line, when he's killing hookers in the inner city. The kid who was nice, who showed compassion, is the anomaly, and is the one who gets locked up for the rest of his life <em>now</em>.</p>
<p>Yeah. Normal sucks.</p>

